All match. ✓

## Computing $s_2(2023)$

Converting $2023$ to binary:
$$2023 = 1024 + 512 + 256 + 128 + 64 + 32 + 4 + 2 + 1 = 11111100111_2$$

Counting the 1-bits: $\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}00\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1}\mathbf{1} = 9$ ones.

## Conclusion

$$v_3(a_{2023}) = s_2(2023) = 9$$

The largest integer $m$ such that $3^m \mid a_{2023}$ is $\boxed{9}$.

